{"3985880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "INTERVOID", "steam_appid": 3985880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985880/extras/7e65794e63c184b25fe46e2fd529ddce.poster.avif?t=1786708290\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985880/extras/7e65794e63c184b25fe46e2fd529ddce.webm?t=1786708290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985880/extras/7e65794e63c184b25fe46e2fd529ddce.mp4?t=1786708290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>INTERVOID</strong> <br>is a tense co-op game for up to 4 players set deep within a haunting, noir-themed subway system. Team up with friends and explore every shadowy corner as you race to reach the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985880/extras/21a4954f5ae741206167e9770366c0f6.poster.avif?t=1786708290\" width=1170 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985880/extras/21a4954f5ae741206167e9770366c0f6.webm?t=1786708290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985880/extras/21a4954f5ae741206167e9770366c0f6.mp4?t=1786708290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985880/extras/748822628f0dc12ffc57017b4c4784c6.poster.avif?t=1786708290\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985880/extras/748822628f0dc12ffc57017b4c4784c6.webm?t=1786708290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985880/extras/748822628f0dc12ffc57017b4c4784c6.mp4?t=1786708290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The abandoned subway is filled with dangerous anomalies, each with unique and unpredictable behaviors. Learning to avoid and outsmart these threats is essential for survival. <br> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985880/extras/51fb87dd8dca8f1949137cbf9f5699d7.poster.avif?t=1786708290\" width=1170 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985880/extras/51fb87dd8dca8f1949137cbf9f5699d7.webm?t=1786708290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985880/extras/51fb87dd8dca8f1949137cbf9f5699d7.mp4?t=1786708290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985880/extras/07a0c21ad7d2392213f5a8f29d47943b.poster.avif?t=1786708290\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985880/extras/07a0c21ad7d2392213f5a8f29d47943b.webm?t=1786708290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985880/extras/07a0c21ad7d2392213f5a8f29d47943b.mp4?t=1786708290\" type=\"v